\newlabel{fig:energies}{{I.3}{11}{Historical \ce {CO2} emissions by regions and activities (A), put into perspective with the evolution of primary energy consumption by source. Data from \textit {Our World in Data}: \url {https://ourworldindata.org/}}{figure.caption.6}{}}
