\newlabel{fig:radiative_forcing}{{I.4}{12}{Effective radiative forcing (A) and associated additional warming (B) for different atmospheric species, from 1750 to 2019. Panel C is the change in global temperature, at 10 and 100 years after a single year pulse of 2019 anthropogenic emissions. Graphics from \citet {intergovernemental_panel_on_climate_change_climate_2023}}{figure.caption.7}{}}
